  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e95d2b5a18d6535a",
      "translationZh": "用于讨论 Qwen 3.8 Flash Next 发布的集中讨论帖。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22115e956aac72c6",
      "translationZh": "微调与去拒绝化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10977cc23f96b2f1",
      "translationZh": "推理服务器支持与配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3efddf83cc4113c",
      "translationZh": "使用体验、基准测试与模型比较",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c3277190a1e4b4a",
      "translationZh": "采用这一架构的首个开放权重版本是 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next，它引入了以下特性：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf29b454b52a4c5e",
      "translationZh": "采用 QSA 的混合注意力：Gated DeltaNet 与门控注意力的组合已被重新设计为 Gated DeltaNet 与 Qwen Sparse Attention（QSA）的组合。QSA 不再选择单个 token 进行处理，而是在微块级别运作。这显著降低了长上下文延迟；随着智能体工作负载在实际使用中越来越占据主导地位，这一改进尤为关键。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4635ae62d16b3f3d",
      "translationZh": "门控残差：带归一化的残差流使深层大语言模型的训练变得可控。门控残差通过逐元素、依赖数据的读取门，以及每个分支上的标量写入门，调节流经加宽残差流的信息。这在各层之间带来了更细粒度的表达能力，同时保持训练稳定性，并将推理开销维持在较低水平。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bbef6488543e854b",
      "translationZh": "N-gram 嵌入：嵌入为参数规模扩展提供了一个独特的维度，与混合专家（MoE）相比，它所需的计算量更少，也更适合卸载。通过使用短 n-gram 进行索引，这种方法使内存受限的加速器能够在不牺牲质量的情况下，高效地扩展参数规模。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d36eadfe9db16222",
      "translationZh": "定制训练方案：将 Muon 和 AdamW 优化器应用于特定权重类别，以最大限度地提高效率。在重新拟合的缩放定律指导下，我们取消了传统的批大小预热，直接以目标批大小开始训练，大幅减少了优化器的总更新步数，同时能够安全地使用更大的学习率，实现稳健收敛。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23eade0d3016e7d1",
      "translationZh": "类型：带视觉编码器的因果语言模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f28182ce758f5183",
      "translationZh": "训练阶段：预训练与后训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1ea63dcf4cb8a1a",
      "translationZh": "参数数量：125B，其中激活参数为 6B，另加 51B 的 n-gram 嵌入和 4B 的 MTP",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f88ba1dba2697936",
      "translationZh": "词元嵌入：248320（填充后）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "494fcec4df1642f3",
      "translationZh": "N-gram 嵌入：20,000,000（第 2 层的二元组/三元组）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05b1a2c917a91378",
      "translationZh": "隐藏层布局：12 × (3 × (Gated DeltaNet → MoE) → 1 × (Qwen Sparse Attention → MoE))",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f5df5fb77d42ed2",
      "translationZh": "线性注意力头数量：V 为 48，QK 为 16",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b08dba589a2ff1e",
      "translationZh": "注意力头数量：Q 为 24，KV 为 2",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d17064eba7e6a44e",
      "translationZh": "旋转位置嵌入维度：64",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe1ef84021f124d1",
      "translationZh": "索引器结构：MQA，具有 4 个查询头和 1 个共享键头",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4ee3b21f7c0ddfc",
      "translationZh": "索引器头维度：128",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7aa41e43ce31a1cd",
      "translationZh": "预算：512 个块或 2048 个词元",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "827d873fe837cbf4",
      "translationZh": "激活的专家数量：10 个路由专家 + 1 个共享专家",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9f5bd34a03fd3e5",
      "translationZh": "专家中间维度：640",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ea2b3d0ddc1aa4e",
      "translationZh": "LM 输出：248320（填充后）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3a54f0e4133760f",
      "translationZh": "MTP：1 层，采用多步训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff86ffbee187b5fe",
      "translationZh": "上下文长度：原生支持 262,144 个 token，可扩展至 1,000,000 个 token。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97e98c519b65e128",
      "translationZh": "推荐的生成采样参数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "940ee959817e381c",
      "translationZh": "思考模式：temperature=1.0 , top_p=0.95 , top_k=20 , min_p=0.0 , presence_penalty=0.0 , repetition_penalty=1.0",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
